*
* Rap command file
*
new/append model
filename 2020.igs
all mappings
read file
set view:0 0.0225518 -0.0158887 0 2.03727 0.5 -0.55667 0.663414 0.866025 0.321394 -0.383022 -1.20185e-16 0.766044 0.642788     
smaller:0
pause
heal model
HEAL:plot grid lines on boundaries (3D) toggle 1
pause
close
*
* Build the connectivity and a global triangulation
*
topology
merge tolerance 0.025
maximum area 0.01
split tolerance factor 1
deltaS 0.35
build edge curves 
merge edge curves 
* the connectivity is determined
pause
*
* triangulate
*
triangulate
* global triangulation
pause
exit
*
* Save the  hull
*
save model
cleanedWhole.hdf
* model has been saved
exit
